- Fix: Replace django_valkey imports with django-vcache raw client
- Fix: Reduce sentry SDK memory overhead by disabling unused integrations
- Fix: Move MCP OAuth endpoints under /mcp prefix to avoid SPA route conflicts
- Fix: Migrate span promotion writes from DuckDB to arro3
- Fix: Detect container memory limit for DuckDB default
- Feat: Add time/host/environment filters to MCP tools for post-deploy observability
- Refactor: Remove requests-mock dependency, remove cgroup v1 fallback from DuckDB memory detection
- Deps: Update django-vcache to v2.0.0 (Rust-based driver, replaces valkey-py)

